WEBVTT

00:08:29.716 --> 00:08:32.556
And that comes down
to a fundamental change in mindset,

00:08:32.596 --> 00:08:35.756
which is instead of thinking
about how we save the ocean,

00:08:35.796 --> 00:08:39.716
we should be thinking
about how we can help the ocean save us.

00:08:39.716 --> 00:08:40.876
Thank you.

00:08:40.916 --> 00:08:46.196
(Applause)